  "limits": [
    "The producer still does not implement complete native overlap or correspondence. The main corpus retains 3 status mismatches and 6 successful maximum scalar mismatches. Matching interval-end mark sets increase from 9 to 16 of 25, including one joint no-report case; among 21 joint reports they increase from 8 to 15. Full permanent mark sets increase from 8 to 10 of 25. Every failure and both local responses remain.",
    "The original line bisector interpretation is not universal: the asymmetric and nearby-endpoint captures expose failures even for parallel lines. The console and window now state the overlap/correspondence limitation for all families. No new endpoint distance-ratio threshold was fitted or inserted in the producer. Endpoint-boundary recipes were chosen adaptively to disprove a hypothesis.",
    "Curved profiles retain source endpoints under a defined transverse-chord condition. This is an independent geometric policy, not a claim to reproduce all native endpoint retention, folded profiles, open/closed matches or multiple overlap components. SubCrv remains unimplemented for this command.",
    "Native SDK and command minima remain separate evidence. The new main corpus matches 8 SDK minima and 16 printed command minima among 21 joint reports. Tied witness positions and some native extrema differ. Numerical extrema remain bounded searches with the inherited kernel limits; no global or continuous Hausdorff certificate.",
    "Parameter recovery reuses the existing shared chart map instead of numerical closest-point inversion. Five existing map tests cover circular spans, adjacent quarter parameters, identity families, composite coincident visits and invalid inputs. A new native distance regression verifies a final-quarter circle maximum retains its final seam visit. Original source image checks remain enabled.",
    "All native captures used the existing owned private headless launcher and KeepMarks/Enter/Cancel workflow, retaining input objects. No Wine/FEX/license configuration or vendor source changed. No additional sanitizer, leak or performance qualification is claimed.",
    "Historical digest values and nonhash metadata are preserved using immutable Git references when shared files changed. The pre-existing 69 unverifiable historical records remain untouched."
  ],
